<</MSIP_Label_a189e4fd-a2fa-47bf-9b21-17f706ee2968_SiteId(5ae1af62-9505-4097-a69a-c1553ef7840e)/viewAble()/ModDate(D:20261013070001-07'00')/MSIP_Label_a189e4fd-a2fa-47bf-9b21-17f706ee2968_Enabled(true)/docType(Products Island of Content)/Author(RR Donnelley)/title(Cisco Wireless 9172 Series Access Points Data Sheet)/Campaigns()/alfrescoDocVersion()/date(2026-10-13T06:59:49.069-07:00)/MSIP_Label_a189e4fd-a2fa-47bf-9b21-17f706ee2968_Method(Privileged)/concept(Products)/Topics()/iaPath(cisco.com#Products#Products)/Creator(þÿ␀M␀i␀c␀r␀o␀s␀o␀f␀t␀®␀ ␀W␀o␀r␀d␀ ␀f␀o␀r␀ ␀M␀i␀c␀r␀o␀s␀o␀f␀t␀ ␀3␀6␀5)/language(en)/CreationDate(D:20260911023159+05'30')/entitlementExpression(contains\( &quot;0,1,2,3,4,7&quot; , $profileField[3] \))/country(US)/secondaryConcept()/documentId(1791900001663136)/Title(Cisco Wireless 9172 Series Access Points Data Sheet)/contentType(cisco.com#US#preSales)/secondaryDoctype()/accessLevel(Customer,Guest,Partner)/Producer(þÿMicrosoft® Word for Microsoft 365; modified using iText 2.1.7 by 1T3XT)/alfrescoTraceID()/fireWall()/downLoadable()/autoPlay()/description(The Cisco® Wireless 9172 Series Wi-Fi 7 access points provide a seamless entry into next-generation wireless networking, delivering reliable, high-performance connectivity for environments like boutique hotels, student housing, retail stores, healthcare clinics, remote work hubs, and distributed business locations such as satellite offices, regional branches, and logistics hubs. With a compact, energy-efficient design and flexible management options, the 9172 Series helps ensure strong, future-ready connectivity without compromising affordability.)>>
